          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "обязательно (obyazátelno) is built on обязать \"to oblige\", from о- and вязать \"to tie, to bind\", Proto-Slavic vęzati: bound to happen."
            }
